<div class="wp-block-group ok-col ok-note"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"ok-h2 ok-h2--left ok-col__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ok-h2 ok-h2--left ok-col__h">A Note from Principal Helena Varga</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"ok-copy"} -->
<p class="ok-copy">When I arrived at Okami College after nineteen years running hotel floors, my objective was straightforward: to create an educational environment where standards are practiced rather than merely discussed. A hotel is a living organism where punctuality, poise, and quiet teamwork matter every single hour. At Okami House, we do not shield our students from the demands of real service; instead, we stand beside them on the floor and show them how professional hoteliers handle every circumstance with grace and composure. We look forward to welcoming you to Rua do Farol 22 for an open morning or a shift trial. — Helena Varga, Principal</p>
